  "time": "2025-04-12T08:31:04.000Z",
  "caption": "I came across a couple of vintage adverts for Chronosport a long since closed specialist sports watch shop in Bath in the South West of England that I thought the watch fam might find QI on this Saturnday 🪐. \n\nClearly an Enicar stockist and the racing driver featured appears to have an Enicar Sherpa Graph on his wrist. I previously shared these with @vandervenus who, not surprisingly, already had them in his Enicar archive. \n\nThe first photo is of my Enicar Sherpa Guide, the first Enicar I ever bought and which came in its original Chronosport box with a Bath 1968 postmark! I subsequently developed Acute Enicaritis, a condition from which I still suffer although I think my affliction is now of the chronic variety… Enjoy!!\n\nAlso a bonus point for anyone who can identify the location on the OS Map!\n#enicar\n#enicarvintage \n#enicarsherpa \n#enicarsherpaguide \n#enicarsofinstagram \n#enicarwatches \n#enicarwatch \n#enicarlover \n#enicaristi \n#enicarsaturnday \n#enicarcollector\n#chronosport\n#chronosportshop \n#chronosportwatches",
